$Mission Desc:
 XSTR("[[Duration: ~13 min | Difficulty: Medium]] A Cylon raiding group has been picking off fleet stragglers from somewhere near the Erebus asteroid cluster. The frigate Halyard will sit in the open as bait. When they come for her, Red flight springs the trap.", -1)
$end_multi_text

